     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">\r\n<div>All</div>\r\n<div>There has been a change in the GitHub site repository for nimble BDM code.</div>\r\n<div>The site now has a direct path to the nimble section:</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://github.com/Andrew9Lawson/Bayesian_DM_Nimble_code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Andrew9Lawson/Bayesian_DM_Nimble_code&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478121381000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31Sm1l-A-k7ay6MQfXBiz7\"><font color=\"#0563C1\"><u>https://github.com/Andrew9Lawson/Bayesian_DM_Nimble_code</u></font></a> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>and has an ICAR branch and a MCAR branch.</div>\r\n<div>The <font face=\"Arial Narrow\">ICAR</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">-</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">and</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">-</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">other</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">-</font><font face=\"Arial Narrow\">code</font>\r\nbranch includes code for </div>\r\n<div>BYM model</div>\r\n<div>BYM2 model</div>\r\n<div>multi scale model</div>\r\n<div>log-normal model and </div>\r\n<div>a space-time example;</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>while the MCAR branch </div>\r\n<div>includes code for </div>\r\n<div>M-models</div>\r\n<div>MICAR and MPCAR</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>best wishes</div>\r\n<div>Andrew</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>Division of Biostatistics and Bioinformatics</div>\r\n<div>Department of Public Health Sciences</div>\r\n<div>Medical University of South Carolina</div>\r\n<div>Charleston</div>\r\n<div>29425</div>\r\n<div>South Carolina</div>\r\n<div>USA</div>\r\n<div>ph: <a href=\"tel:(843)%20876-1865\" value=\"+18438761865\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">843-876-1865</a></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>new 3rd edition of BDM book:</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http